yake-cpp

This project implements the YAKE keyword extraction algorithm described by:

Ricardo Campos, Vítor Mangaravite, Arian Pasquali, Alípio Jorge, Célia Nunes,
and Adam Jatowt. "YAKE! Keyword extraction from single documents using
multiple local features." Information Sciences 509 (2020), 257-289.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ins.2019.09.013

